pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |-
  LSTM 模型：图 13 为内部节点结构；输入 x_t = {SOC, Q, T_e, P_l, C}，输出剩余续驶里程。
  三门结构选择性保留序列信息，缓解长序列梯度消失与爆炸。
elements:
  - elementId: chapter-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: chapter-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 11, 720, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: '03. 预测模型 —— LSTM 结构与输入'
  - elementId: chapter-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 20, 176, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.8
      color: "$accent6"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: EV RANGE · 学术报告
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 三门结构把 SOC、Q 与工况映射为逐时刻里程
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 104, 864, 16]
