    fit: { mode: contain }
  - elementId: fig-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 316, 832, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.2
      text: |-
        <p><span style="color:$accent;font-weight:bold;">图 13</span>　LSTM 神经网络内部节点结构：遗忘门、输入门、输出门与细胞状态的时序传递</p>
