    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      text: |-
        <p>\(x_t = \{\mathrm{SOC},\ Q,\ T_e,\ P_l,\ C\}\)</p>
  - elementId: input-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 412, 388, 44]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.2
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 依次为电池荷电状态、驾驶行为量化因子、环境温度、电器用电负荷率、速度工况；三门结构缓解长序列梯度消失与爆炸。
  - elementId: gates-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [492, 352, 420, 112]
