  - elementId: gates-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [508, 382, 388, 74]
    content:
      fontSize: 9.6
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.75
      text: |-
        <p>遗忘门　\(f_t = \sigma\left(W_f [h_{t-1}, x_t] + b_f\right)\)</p>
        <p>细胞态　\(C_t = f_t C_{t-1} + i_t g_t\)</p>
        <p>输出门　\(h_t = o_t \otimes \tanh(C_t)\)</p>
